      "turn": 0,
      "assistant": "I'll analyze the example first.\n\n**Observation:** The input has a 5\u00d75 frame of color 4 (rows 3\u20137, cols 0\u20134) with a single 6 at (6,2). The output keeps the frame and adds 6s at (4,2), (5,1), (5,3), (6,2) \u2014 exactly the four orthogonal neighbors of the frame's center (5,2). So the rule appears to be: draw a diamond of 6s around the center of the frame.\n\nLet me propose candidate rules.",
      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "id": "call_01a0c7c36cde71729870d329",
          "name": "propose_hypotheses",
          "arguments": "{\"hypotheses\":[{\"nl\":\"Draw a diamond (4 orthogonal neighbors) of 6s around the center of the 4-colored frame.\",\"code\":\"def transform(grid):\\n    g=[row[:] for row in grid]\\n    H=len(g); W=len(g[0])\\n    fours=[(r,c) for r in range(H) for c in range(W) if g[r][c]==4]\\n    rmin=min(r for r,c in fours); rmax=max(r for r,c in fours)\\n    cmin=min(c for r,c in fours); cmax=max(c for r,c in fours)\\n    cr=(rmin+rmax)//2; cc=(cmin+cmax)//2\\n    for dr,dc in [(-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)]:\\n        nr,nc=cr+dr,cc+dc\\n        if 0<=nr<H and 0<=nc<W:\\n            g[nr][nc]=6\\n    return g\"},{\"nl\":\"Draw a diamond of 6s around the input 6's position.\",\"code\":\"def transform(grid):\\n    g=[row[:] for row in grid]\\n    H=len(g); W=len(g[0])\\n    sixes=[(r,c) for r in range(H) for c in range(W) if g[r][c]==6]\\n    if not sixes: return g\\n    cr,cc=sixes[0]\\n    for dr,dc in [(-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)]:\\n        nr,nc=cr+dr,cc+dc\\n        if 0<=nr<H and 0<=nc<W:\\n            g[nr][nc]=6\\n    return g\"},{\"nl\":\"Draw a diamond of 6s around the frame center and also set the center itself to 6.\",\"code\":\"def transform(grid):\\n    g=[row[:] for row in grid]\\n    H=len(g); W=len(g[0])\\n    fours=[(r,c) for r in range(H) for c in range(W) if g[r][c]==4]\\n    rmin=min(r for r,c in fours); rmax=max(r for r,c in fours)\\n    cmin=min(c for r,c in fours); cmax=max(c for r,c in fours)\\n    cr=(rmin+rmax)//2; cc=(cmin+cmax)//2\\n    g[cr][cc]=6\\n    for dr,dc in [(-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)]:\\n        nr,nc=cr+dr,cc+dc\\n        if 0<=nr<H and 0<=nc<W:\\n            g[nr][nc]=6\\n    return g\"},{\"nl\":\"Draw a diamond around the frame center with radius equal to the Manhattan distance from the 6 to the center.\",\"code\":\"def transform(grid):\\n    g=[row[:] for row in grid]\\n    H=len(g); W=len(g[0])\\n    fours=[(r,c) for r in range(H) for c in range(W) if g[r][c]==4]\\n    sixes=[(r,c) for r in range(H) for c in range(W) if g[r][c]==6]\\n    rmin=min(r for r,c in fours); rmax=max(r for r,c in fours)\\n    cmin=min(c for r,c in fours); cmax=max(c for r,c in fours)\\n    cr=(rmin+rmax)//2; cc=(cmin+cmax)//2\\n    d=abs(sixes[0][0]-cr)+abs(sixes[0][1]-cc) if sixes else 1\\n    for dr,dc in [(-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)]:\\n        for k in range(1,d+1):\\n            nr,nc=cr+dr*k,cc+dc*k\\n            if 0<=nr<H and 0<=nc<W:\\n                g[nr][nc]=6\\n    return g\"},{\"nl\":\"Draw a plus of 6s from the frame center out to the frame edges.\",\"code\":\"def transform(grid):\\n    g=[row[:] for row in grid]\\n    H=len(g); W=len(g[0])\\n    fours=[(r,c) for r in range(H) for c in range(W) if g[r][c]==4]\\n    rmin=min(r for r,c in fours); rmax=max(r for r,c in fours)\\n    cmin=min(c for r,c in fours); cmax=max(c for r,c in fours)\\n    cr=(rmin+rmax)//2; cc=(cmin+cmax)//2\\n    for r in range(rmin+1,rmax):\\n        g[r][cc]=6\\n    for c in range(cmin+1,cmax):\\n        g[cr][c]=6\\n    return g\"},{\"nl\":\"Draw a diamond around the frame center using the color of the non-frame colored cell.\",\"code\":\"def transform(grid):\\n    g=[row[:] for row in grid]\\n    H=len(g); W=len(g[0])\\n    fours=[(r,c) for r in range(H) for c in range(W) if g[r][c]==4]\\n    others=[(r,c) for r in range(H) for c in range(W) if g[r][c] not in (0,4)]\\n    col=g[others[0][0]][others[0][1]] if others else 6\\n    rmin=min(r for r,c in fours); rmax=max(r for r,c in fours)\\n    cmin=min(c for r,c in fours); cmax=max(c for r,c in fours)\\n    cr=(rmin+rmax)//2; cc=(cmin+cmax)//2\\n    for dr,dc in [(-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)]:\\n        nr,nc=cr+dr,cc+dc\\n        if 0<=nr<H and 0<=nc<W:\\n            g[nr][nc]=col\\n    return g\"},{\"nl\":\"Draw diamonds of 6s around both the frame center and the input 6.\",\"code\":\"def transform(grid):\\n    g=[row[:] for row in grid]\\n    H=len(g); W=len(g[0])\\n    fours=[(r,c) for r in range(H) for c in range(W) if g[r][c]==4]\\n    sixes=[(r,c) for r in range(H) for c in range(W) if g[r][c]==6]\\n    rmin=min(r for r,c in fours); rmax=max(r for r,c in fours)\\n    cmin=min(c for r,c in fours); cmax=max(c for r,c in fours)\\n    cr=(rmin+rmax)//2; cc=(cmin+cmax)//2\\n    for (br,bc) in [(cr,cc)]+sixes:\\n        for dr,dc in [(-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)]:\\n            nr,nc=br+dr,bc+dc\\n            if 0<=nr<H and 0<=nc<W:\\n                g[nr][nc]=6\\n    return g\"},{\"nl\":\"Draw a diamond of 6s around the frame center, restricted to cells strictly inside the frame.\",\"code\":\"def transform(grid):\\n    g=[row[:] for row in grid]\\n    H=len(g); W=len(g[0])\\n    fours=[(r,c) for r in range(H) for c in range(W) if g[r][c]==4]\\n    rmin=min(r for r,c in fours); rmax=max(r for r,c in fours)\\n    cmin=min(c for r,c in fours); cmax=max(c for r,c in fours)\\n    cr=(rmin+rmax)//2; cc=(cmin+cmax)//2\\n    for dr,dc in [(-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)]:\\n        nr,nc=cr+dr,cc+dc\\n        if rmin<nr<rmax and cmin<nc<cmax:\\n            g[nr][nc]=6\\n    return g\"}]}"
